      "source": "An extension of <a href=\"AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver</code></a> for named value\nresolvers that are synchronous and yet non-blocking. Subclasses implement\nthe synchronous <a href=\"#resolveNamedValue(java.lang.String,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\"><code>resolveNamedValue(String, MethodParameter, ServerWebExchange)</code></a> to which the asynchronous\n<a href=\"#resolveName(java.lang.String,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\"><code>resolveName(String, MethodParameter, ServerWebExchange)</code></a> delegates to by default.",
